d the boughs of leafy trees and of willows of the brook. And you are to rejoice before the LORD your God for seven days.","from":14},{"book":"LEV","chapter":23,"verse":43,"verseEnd":43,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"so that your descendants may know that I made the Israelites dwell in booths when I brought them out of the land of Egypt. I am the LORD your God.’”","from":14},{"book":"DEU","chapter":16,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"You are to celebrate the Feast of Tabernacles for seven days after you have gathered the produce of your threshing floor and your winepress.","from":14},{"book":"DEU","chapter":16,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"For seven days you shall celebrate a feast to the LORD your God in the place He will choose, because the LORD your God will bless you in all your produce and in all the work of your hands, so that your joy will be complete.","from":14},{"book":"LEV","chapter":23,"verse":36,"verseEnd":36,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"For seven days you are to present a food offering to the LORD. On the eighth day you are to hold a sacred assembly and present a food offering to the LORD. It is a solemn assembly; you must not do any regular work.","from":18},{"book":"LEV","chapter":23,"verse":40,"verseEnd":40,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"On the first day you are to gather the fruit of majestic trees, the branches of palm trees, and the boughs of leafy trees and of willows of the brook. And you are to rejoice before the LORD your God for seven days.","from":15},{"book":"NUM","chapter":29,"verse":35,"verseEnd":35,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"On the eighth day you are to hold a solemn assembly; you must not do any regular work.","from":18}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]}}